ToyOS — third-party material
============================

ToyOS is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0, at your option. Both texts are in
the repository: `LICENSE-MIT` and `LICENSE-APACHE`.

Some of what this repository carries is not ours and is under other terms.
This file is the list. It exists because until 2026-08-08 there wasn't one: an
audit that day found six committed binary files — 11,094,369 bytes of the
14,634,080 git tracks — plus a source corpus, all outside the declared licence
and none of them documented. Everything here is an obligation somebody has to
be able to find.

Each section names its terms on one `SPDX-License-Identifier:` line, which
agrees with the licence column of `COMMITTED_FILES` in `src/licence.rs` for
every file both name, and that file judges what an image ships by them.

**If you redistribute a ToyOS image, read the DOOM1.WAD entry.** It is the one
that constrains what you may do with a build.


